Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:22.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jiri Lehecka brings down the curtain on Stan Wawrinka's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱赫奇卡 为他的生涯落下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:26.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}日夜里 巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁的瓦林卡 在家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:32.03,TL,,0,0,0,,打完了职业生涯的最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:35.94,TL,,0,0,0,,很多人第一次记住他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.39,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}2008{\fs68}年北京奥运会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}23{\fs68}岁的他 和费德勒搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.95,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下了男双金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:02.53,TL,,0,0,0,,可在单打里 他一直站在费德勒身后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:05.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2013{\fs68}年澳网第四轮 {\fs78}27{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:08.23,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}2{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.95,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}12{\fs68} 他输了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:42.08,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后他却说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:44.45,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他打过最好的一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:47.33,TL,,0,0,0,,他的左臂上 纹着贝克特的一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:50.84,TL,,0,0,0,,再试 再败 败得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:53.55,TL,,0,0,0,,一年后 同一块场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.85,TL,,0,0,0,,他决胜盘{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}赢了德约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:58.79,TL,,0,0,0,,终结了对手在澳网的{\fs78}25{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:00.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}天后的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:02.58,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:19.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After a final that was dramatic and bizarre and puzzling,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场跌宕又离奇的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:24.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it all ends well for Stan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后 斯坦笑到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:30.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He is the man in Melbourne, the 2014 Australian Open Champion,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是墨尔本之王 {\fs78}2014{\fs68}澳网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:35.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the first time he claims Grand Slam glory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一次拿下大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}个月后 蒙特卡洛大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:40.85,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:42.99,TL,,0,0,0,,先丢一盘 他逆转拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:46.38,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他生涯唯一一座大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stan is the man in Monte Carlo,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯坦是蒙特卡洛的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:10.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wawrinka claims his first ever Masters 1000 title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦林卡拿下生涯第一个大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.27,TL,,0,0,0,,那年{\fs78}11{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:14.91,TL,,0,0,0,,戴维斯杯决赛在法国里尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:16.55,TL,,0,0,0,,他先拿下首场单打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.66,TL,,0,0,0,,又和费德勒赢下双打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:21.20,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一天 费德勒锁定胜局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.93,TL,,0,0,0,,瑞士第一次捧起了戴维斯杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:30.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Federer remained in complete control{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费德勒牢牢掌控局面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:33.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and nothing would stop him from achieving another personal goal in an amazing career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没有什么能阻止他再圆一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:46.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}History was made. Switzerland, the 2014 champions.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N历史诞生了 瑞士 {\fs78}2014{\fs68}年冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年法网 {\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.82,TL,,0,0,0,,他直落{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢了费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:59.20,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 又是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.61,TL,,0,0,0,,那一年德约拿了另外{\fs78}3{\fs68}个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:04.27,TL,,0,0,0,,唯独这一个 被他拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:45.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年美网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:48.63,TL,,0,0,0,,他一度只差一分就出局 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:52.40,TL,,0,0,0,,他第三次在大满贯决赛面对世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:05.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that's how it happens.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就这样 一切尘埃落定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:10.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stan Wawrinka wins his third Grand Slam and the 2016 US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦林卡拿下第{\fs78}3{\fs68}个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}次大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}个世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68} 他一场没输
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:26.70,TL,,0,0,0,,来得晚的巅峰 一样是巅峰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:30.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年法网半决赛 {\fs78}32{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:34.44,TL,,0,0,0,,和头号种子穆雷打了{\fs78}4{\fs68}小时{\fs78}34{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.83,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.75,TL,,0,0,0,,他打进了第四次大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:09.60,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 他输给了纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:12.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.43,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他{\fs78}4{\fs68}次大满贯决赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.49,TL,,0,0,0,,唯一输掉的一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.30,TL,,0,0,0,,那年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:52.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}32{\fs68}岁的他左膝连做两次手术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:55.53,TL,,0,0,0,,排名后来跌到{\fs78}260{\fs68}名开外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他又爬了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:01.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年法网 {\fs78}34{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:05.30,TL,,0,0,0,,和{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的西西帕斯打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}9{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:40.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年 最后一个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:43.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}40{\fs68}岁的他拿外卡打进澳网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.07,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}1978{\fs68}年以来的第一人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.71,TL,,0,0,0,,输球之后 他对看台说了这样几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:55.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the reason why I was still playing is because of you,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我还在打 是因为你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because of the love of the game, the emotion you can give me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N因为热爱 因为你们给我的感动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:03.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm sad to leave, but it's been an amazing journey.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N要走了很难过 但这一路太精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:07.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's hard to envision anything beyond that backhand,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说起他 先想到的总是单反
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:11.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but when you look beyond those three Grand Slam titles,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可在三座大满贯之外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:16.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}perhaps his greatest contribution to tennis is proof that courage,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他最大的贡献 也许是证明了勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:21.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}patience and late-blooming belief can carve out greatness,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N耐心和大器晚成的信念
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:27.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}even in an era dominated by the giants of the sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在巨头的时代也能成就伟大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:28.74,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:31.71,TL,,0,0,0,,罗兰 加洛斯为他办了告别仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.61,TL,,0,0,0,,他一次次抬手擦眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:35.58,TL,,0,0,0,,看台上的人全站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.98,TL,,0,0,0,,掌声很久都没有停
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}月{\fs78}30{\fs68}日 温网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:48.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他和贝雷蒂尼鏖战{\fs78}4{\fs68}小时{\fs78}20{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:51.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘 全都打进了抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.39,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘他握有{\fs78}6{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.10,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}16{\fs68}比{\fs78}18{\fs68}还是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.03,TL,,0,0,0,,温网破例
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:59.97,TL,,0,0,0,,给了输球的他一次场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:05.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's never easy to say goodbye to something that you love so much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N和自己深爱的东西告别 从来不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:08.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've always been passionate about the game, always enjoyed that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我一直热爱网球 一直乐在其中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:16.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm grateful, and I'd like to thank everybody, because I had the chance to play one last time here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢大家 让我能在这里打最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I couldn't have dreamed of a better goodbye.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我梦想不到的好告别
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:21.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So thank you so much for the support.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢你们的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.49,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月{\fs78}31{\fs68}日 美网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:26.56,TL,,0,0,0,,他又输给了贝雷蒂尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.51,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他最后一场大满贯比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Beautiful way to wrap it up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮地结束了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:43.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is victory for Matteo Berrettini, and it is a result that brings{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝雷蒂尼赢了 这个结果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:49.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the curtain down on Stan Wawrinka's glittering career at the majors.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为瓦林卡辉煌的大满贯生涯落下帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:56.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The three-time major winner and 2016 champion here in New York{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三届大满贯得主 {\fs78}2016{\fs68}美网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:59.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}plays his last match in this famous city,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在纽约打完最后一场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:08.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it will surely be an emotional goodbye to this sell-out Grandstand crowd.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这注定是和满场观众的一场动情告别
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:13.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But over the years I received so much support, so much love because of you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这些年 你们给了我太多支持和爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:17.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I really enjoyed that. I found the way to play my best tennis here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很享受 在这里打出了最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:21.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was always really special,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里一直很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:25.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and tonight again was one of the reasons why I kept playing until 41:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今晚再次告诉我 为何打到{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to live those moments like you gave me tonight, like you gave us tonight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就为了今晚你们给我的这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:31.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Amazing support, so thank you so much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢你们 太感谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.89,0:10:34.68,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一站 是家乡巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:36.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}26{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:38.01,TL,,0,0,0,,球场为他办了一场告别
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:40.48,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒发来了一段视频
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:45.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Je te souhaite le meilleur.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N祝你一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:48.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Un petit mot en français, comme ça tu me comprends aussi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用一点法语说 你也能听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Je pense à toi, tu me manques, je t'aime, mon gars.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我惦记你 想念你 我爱你 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:55.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Et enjoy le moment à Bâle, chez moi, à Bâle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在我家乡巴塞尔 享受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Allez, à bientôt, ciao ciao.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加油 后会有期 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:11:00.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}On voulait te remercier pour ce tournoi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们想谢谢你 谢谢这站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Malheureusement, je n'ai jamais réussi à le gagner.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可惜的是 我从来没能赢下它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:06.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Roger est passé plus d'une fois ici, donc ça a été plus compliqué.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N罗杰来过不止一次 所以更难了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:08.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mais mes meilleurs souvenirs, pour moi,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但对我来说 最好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:11.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}pour pouvoir terminer ici, en Suisse, c'est un rêve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是能在瑞士收官 像一场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:14.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}C'est un rêve, après plus de vingt ans de carrière,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二十多年职业生涯之后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:17.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}finir une dernière fois à la maison, sur un tel tournoi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一次在家乡的这项大赛收官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:18.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}C'est exceptionnel. Merci beaucoup.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太特别了 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:21.09,TL,,0,0,0,,最后 他绕场一周
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.58,TL,,0,0,0,,手机灯光亮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:25.00,TL,,0,0,0,,像给他点了一场星海
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.11,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天晚上 同一块场地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.11,0:11:30.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他打了职业生涯的最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:32.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:35.10,TL,,0,0,0,,他输给了{\fs78}8{\fs68}号种子莱赫奇卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.03,TL,,0,0,0,,全场的掌声 都给了他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:48.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A suitcase of incredible memories, in a career that has spanned 23 years,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N满满一箱回忆 {\fs78}23{\fs68}年的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:52.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and whose shot-making has dazzled us for decades,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他的击球 让我们惊艳了几十年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:56.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but that all comes to an end this evening.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而这一切 在今晚画上句号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.30,TL,,0,0,0,,他背起球包 手放在胸口
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.43,TL,,0,0,0,,向看台挥了挥手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:08.42,TL,,0,0,0,,试过 败过 再试 再败 败得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:09.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}座大满贯之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.90,TL,,0,0,0,,他在家乡说了再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.41,TL,,0,0,0,,你最记得他的哪一场？
